<title>UK: Ldn gold fixes lower, seen vulnerable to downside.</title>
<headline>Ldn gold fixes lower, seen vulnerable to downside.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixed at $333.60 versus $334.55. Fresh low fixing since March 30, 1993. Support seen at $332, below that, key level is $325.00.</p>
<p>SILVER - Off one cent at $4.65/$4.67. Support at $4.60.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Higher at $435.00/$440.00, up $11.00, after firming in Asian trading.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Also up $2.00 at $192.00/$196.00.</p>
</text>
